Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\Nin the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up\Nour thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With the foolish ones\Nwe love, we'll carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The bonds built between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know, that's\Nwhat we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.88,0:01:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.58,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.71,0:02:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder you're frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time you try to take\Na stand, I knock you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you notice when you\Ntried to throw a left punch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I targeted your left shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you tried to throw a right punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I targeted your right shoulder. All\Nof your efforts have been in vain;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you are nothing but a fool\Ndrowning in your own failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what it's like when your\Nenemy can predict your every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Forcing you to lash out in\Ndesperation is just the appetizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you throw a left\Nkick or a right kick,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I will strike you before\Nyou can even make contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't let up until I\Nsee your heart burst in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's intent behind every attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A hint, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't attack your foe blindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's infrequent, but he's able\Nto see the future, same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.28,0:04:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a biscuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I screwed up big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It totally slipped my mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was supposed to pipe roses of\Nwhipped cream on the top of the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pastry bag, please? Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:04:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Skywalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool! It's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bam! It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate wedding cake masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's it look? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible, Lili!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Smells so good I could paint!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It came out great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This cake don't even need to\Nbe full of poison after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That big broad's gonna drop\Nafter one bite. Arrivederci!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The cake's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Made it just in time. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:06:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they all collapsing suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They really must have\Nworked their asses off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother getting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We already know all about your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku Island, 1am, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends won't even get\Nthe chance to reach the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon they'll be met by my brother's fleets\Nwaiting in anticipation of their arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And the same fate is in store for you,\Nshould you manage to escape somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still gonna make it out\Nof here, one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.76,0:07:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound confident, like\Nit's destined to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Pudding and Chiffon, couldn't\Nhave done it without you. Thanks a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, with this cake, I'll\Ndefinitely save my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you know that for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the cake is finished\Nand all, but big whoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to tell ya, but\Nthey might be dead already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, he even knows if Mama\Nwill like the cake or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,this seems like a big\Nwaste of time bringing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,this Serious excuse of\Na cake to your Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him you didn't mean it pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case is, it's\Ntoo late to worry now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my wedding cape! Now! Let's rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for monster point!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure she doesn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? A monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They have monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Napoleon, are you prepared? Extend!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy us as much time as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're always right here beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Until that moment arrives, we will\Nendure whatever she can heave our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.18,0:08:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom doesn't know it's coming her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest cake ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I will beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go and rejoin my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.26,0:09:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my friends believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slice you in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to use Ghost Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:09:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Stop! You're hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, do your worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can at least drag you into the\Nmurky waters with me before I go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fiery one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if this is still a good on\Nthat threat after you witness this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.72,0:10:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.80,0:10:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At that size, no amount\Nof seawater will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so, so fiercely. Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how far you guys can run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stick around, or we'll\Nburn up alongside the summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame, since we've\Nmanaged to make it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention, Sanji\Nwill be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been fun, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where's my cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, where is that coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop getting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you expect to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His observation Haki is nearly\Nsharp enough to compete with my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't put an end to him soon,\Nthe unthinkable could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's their ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sancti's crew really pulled through!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The lights! Sancti! Sancti!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, that smells good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Blackleg, looks like\Nwe got eyes on your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stinking Prometheus, look\Nhow freaking huge you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Powered up by Big Mom's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to say it, but look\Nwho he's toting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Big Mom up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, there's a fleet, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can spot Patty Sparrow and Bob O 'Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus Smoothie and her crew, too. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how you look at\Nit, that spells trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like the Straw Hat\Nships in rough shape, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Ready, boys? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, this is Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.36,0:13:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fool around with her. Capisce?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You plug that dame full of lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then light her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like your crew's been\Nrunning from Big Mom all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really hung in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your captain ain't even with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a Noodle Man on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's releasing some weird power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt that's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are they arriving\Non Benji's ship, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.26,0:14:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think someone's dancing on the bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What really matters is the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.76,0:14:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They managed to recreate the wedding cake
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,down to every last\Nlickety-dollop and detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope it passes the taste test.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing else can stop Mama's madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:14:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy is standing right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.78,0:15:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That cake is bound to be poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the smell she backed\Noff, I really got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I thought I was a gunner for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we attempt to destroy\Nthe replacement wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, if we do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,then there will be no stopping Mama from
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,lickety-liquidating\NToto Land as we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the cake is poisoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.02,0:15:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,then both the country and the pirate\Noperation will crumble without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a lickety-lose-lose situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Black Leg, you got yourself a deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Paulie, and don't worry—we'll\Nstep aside, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,can handle the cake from here and there;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,won't be any aggression\Ntill that bird has a fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free to do as I please afterwards,\Nyeah, that's correct—I only had one job:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the wedding cake—bake a new\None to calm big mom down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it all\Nright—we're ready, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming then—hurry, the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,up, unless you want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.46,0:16:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey pudding—take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,die hey pudding
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,take it easy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Chip on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.26,0:16:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better make this fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go quickly enough that\Nneither of my brothers notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that be my wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it had to be around! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.66,0:17:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn Starboy! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Go southwest at full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Head toward Lock Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Press, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship with the cake has\Nsuddenly changed course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're enticing Mama to\Nfollow Bezzy's ship for some reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety-leading Mama away, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that they are trying to\Ndivide us by forcing us to split up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji! It's Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm putting too! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We were barely hanging on by a thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.30,0:18:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama Bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you too, Nami, my sweet honey pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Sanji, why\Nwere you on Veggie's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where precisely is this ship headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody exactly knows what Big Mom will\Ndo after she finishes eating the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So Buggy and his men are luring her to\Nthe closest island just to be safe. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he willingly\Nvolunteer to be bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What could he be getting out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he hasn't given\Nup on murdering her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonny's safety is the only\Nthing that matters to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can keep Big Mom away from\Nit, then I can't ask for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look, poor Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.06,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I failed to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We would have been lost\Nwithout you, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We can catch up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just relieved you're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what are Pedro and\NKaren up to at the moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, they're in the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, and they're both wiped\Nout from all the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Press, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.30,0:19:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we chase?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Brahat or Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.82,0:19:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let him lickety\Nleave with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bada-bada-bada-bada-bada.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Press, it's me, Veggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Veggie, you backstabber!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you the one\Nlickety-lugging that cake around?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be dealing with Mama's hunger pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.22,0:19:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let her have her fill the cake until\Nshe calms down. You rat! Liar! Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you put in the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You messed with it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you there's\Nnothing wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Puddin had a\Nhand in making the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then tell\Nme where she is right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry about\Nthe details if I was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.14,0:20:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should focus on\Ntaking care of Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.18,0:20:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I got things down pat on my head, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Calvick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiji! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going after that\Nbastard, Bavawa! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 100 % positive he's plotting to\Ngo through with the assassination!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lickety-likely he's done\Nsomething to pudding as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think so, Pedos?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should follow Straw Hat's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It will sink a cacao island anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.02,0:20:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,did you forget that we\Nhave a certain someone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,who we can count on to finish the mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.70,0:20:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you pick up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Smoothie,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.60,0:20:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know if you're still a part\Nof the fleet trailing the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.68,0:21:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right on your tail, Pedos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to stick to the Straw Hats\Nlike your lickety-life depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Boboar and I are going\Nafter Buggy and Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Squeeze every last drop of lively life\Nfrom those rotten little trespassers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop tormenting them until\Nthey jump off the edge of sanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Abundantly so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Perlick: If that's what he wanted, then he\Nshould have just asked me from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.72,0:21:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our poor brother, Press.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting distracted, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have stayed put on Cacao Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really enjoying all\Nthe tea and chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just being impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,These men are such idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No time for complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's prepare for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.04,0:22:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to sink Straw Hat's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall stop them before\Nthey reach Kaku Island. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.76,0:22:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They know it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even where we're meeting Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet Kaku Island's\Nsurrounded with ships by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that they are treating us as\Na true threat, which is unusual for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be our final obstacle,\Nbut likely our biggest as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna rescue Luffy no matter\Nwhat and then make a break for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.04,0:22:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.95,0:22:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have to avoid their fleets at all\Ncosts or else we're gonna be done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.52,0:23:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You look pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your foot slipped, you amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.06,0:23:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my plan is working!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:23:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bra!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that I was helping all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.86,0:24:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I hadn't realized that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.46,0:24:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a good girl you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Flampe, you truly are my favorite sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.16,0:24:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I miss Clippers. I am cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.80,0:24:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one moment of recklessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.50,0:24:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what can decide a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.70,0:24:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Never let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.60,0:25:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't see another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.18,0:25:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when I was starting\Nto admit you were worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.26,0:25:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a disappointment!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.30,0:26:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I imagine that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.14,0:26:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.96,0:26:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagination is part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.00,0:26:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond such tricks of the mind,\Nyou will find observation, Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.52,0:26:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, it's something you\Nlearn to feel out subconsciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.70,0:26:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Subconsciously?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.38,0:27:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stood up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.40,0:27:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's looking pretty shaky, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.50,0:27:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, one more. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.16,0:27:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This time I'll nail you with a numbing\Nneedle ten times more potent than the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.78,0:27:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This will show you for\Nwasting my brother's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.76,0:27:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop dead, you dirty little ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.10,0:27:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Numbin' Needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.64,0:27:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.55,0:27:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My Needle was totally silent!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.50,0:27:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the heck did he dodge?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.62,0:27:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The moron fell down anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.40,0:28:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.64,0:28:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna notice us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.24,0:28:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.00,0:28:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.44,0:28:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tramble like a newborn mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.38,0:28:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a pathetic sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.92,0:28:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wabble wabble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.06,0:28:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid's so laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.82,0:28:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.16,0:28:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.50,0:28:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's drenched in blood and stumbling\Naround, but he doesn't know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.68,0:28:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.12,0:29:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His determination is\Nalmost too much to stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.72,0:29:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw in the towel already.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.20,0:29:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Slumpay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.50,0:29:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.44,0:29:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.35,0:29:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Big Brown might\Nbe looking right at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.22,0:29:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so cool. I just want to screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.58,0:29:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get freaked out, but I\Nthink he's coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.52,0:29:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.04,0:30:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a splendid\Nlittle sister, Flampe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.08,0:30:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.76,0:30:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to freeze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.00,0:30:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The day has finally come.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.12,0:30:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.96,0:30:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.40,0:30:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was you, Flampe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.90,0:30:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,By using that blowgun you love so\Nmuch, you took away his mobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.00,0:30:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,During our heated standoff, your\Ninterference caused his focus to falter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.62,0:30:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew something felt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.52,0:30:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That was when I landed the blow that\Nripped a bloody hole in his torso.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.14,0:31:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that I'd want to\Nclaim victory in such a dishonorable way?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.48,0:31:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seeing this crap, Lady Flumpe?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.74,0:31:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The wounded animal's getting back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.54,0:31:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that made me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.40,0:31:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.31,0:31:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Little baby deer walking for his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.76,0:31:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't wait to see General\NKatakuri beat the crap out of this idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.50,0:31:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.41,0:31:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be another flawless victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.34,0:31:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick his butt, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.02,0:31:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Flop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.22,0:31:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.90,0:31:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.94,0:31:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.85,0:31:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it all for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.86,0:31:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't I just the cutest,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.62,0:31:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,sweetest, and most considerate\Nout of all of your little sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.50,0:31:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No one in the world is more perfect than\Nyou and I get to be your save! Lucky me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.76,0:31:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll collect those haircuts now, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.32,0:31:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.28,0:31:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.42,0:32:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.46,0:32:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.30,0:32:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.10,0:32:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.82,0:32:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When a man goes to battle,\Ndon't patronize him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.56,0:32:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.56,0:32:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.82,0:33:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, gold man!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.62,0:33:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you laugh at a man fighting for his\Nlife, then why not have a laugh at me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.62,0:33:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.56,0:33:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.47,0:33:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.58,0:33:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.49,0:33:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.52,0:33:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so gross?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.06,0:33:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you put the calm, cool, and\Ncollected big bro that I love and admire?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.70,0:33:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell has gotten into you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you stab yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.48,0:33:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You big lame ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.18,0:34:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You are totally not the same\Ncut of curry that I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.52,0:34:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.40,0:34:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You pelican eel looking bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.42,0:34:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what he looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.96,0:34:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Lady Pompey! I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.98,0:34:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pee my pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.00,0:34:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.34,0:34:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You really let me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.42,0:34:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes a pelican eel! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.56,0:34:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.38,0:34:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.54,0:34:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you gonna say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.86,0:34:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and take some pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.76,0:35:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get the word out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone needs to see\Nthis messed up space!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.30,0:35:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.32,0:35:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.50,0:35:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you might hold\Nit still for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.78,0:35:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,General Katakuri, can you\Nlook over here real quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That chum for me does\Nlook like a pelican eel!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.06,0:35:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The flawless big brother I once had\Nis dead to me now. You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.30,0:35:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, Charlotte Katakuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.36,0:35:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send these photos\Nof your freaky face to
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.04,0:35:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,every fan club never in\Nevery island in Totoland!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.88,0:35:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you splutter\Nyour grimy blood on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.54,0:35:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the price you pay for\Nsnubbing your favorite little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.16,0:35:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I\Nthought you were perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.62,0:35:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.14,0:35:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed to admit\Nthat I'm related to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.86,0:35:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're both gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.54,0:35:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and don't think I forgot how you\Nruined the tea party, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.22,0:36:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking at your dumb\Nfaces is annoying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.42,0:36:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aiming straight for\Nthe heart this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.92,0:36:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy venomous needles!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.12,0:36:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What has happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.52,0:36:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.70,0:36:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you walk away from this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.24,0:36:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of everyone's commentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.82,0:36:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't be able to\Nstand after this anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.18,0:36:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's monkey, pet monkey\Ncan use it too, but it is a jump!
